flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5695391Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5695937Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5696192Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5696594Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5697688Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5698058Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5698454Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5699189Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5699550Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5700294Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5701147Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5701755Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T14:44:53.5702168Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
